A||||3||hugh||My brother's poems||||1||
Z||000000||hugh||10-14-2000||04:59 PM||||Today is my youngest sister's birthday,It is also the 24th anniversary of my youngest brother's death.He was just about to turn 26.He knew he was dying,the rest of our family didn't.He had put together a Harley and wasn't strong enough to drive it.After his death we found these poems with his belongings.Please don't think them morbid,he was dying and was trying to relieve his dispare.This is hard for me to do emotionally,but I would like other people besides my family to know how he might have felt.<BR>                    <BR>                   Falling Out<BR>Weakened with sickness<BR>poisoned with doubt<BR>I see the light...<BR>falling out,falling out<P>The sky is so clear<BR>no need to tell <BR>I see it so faintly<BR>from the bottom of this well<BR>the light must be heaven<BR>and this surely hell<BR>falling out,falling out<P>Some men leave as they enter<BR>surely you've heard them cry<BR>when they are born<BR>and again when they're<BR>falling out,falling out<P>                    Going down<BR>Woke up this morning<BR>looking at the bottom of my bed<BR>felt so damn bad,had to be said<BR>better off dead.....going down<P>I'd seen a spider cry<BR>tricked by a fly<BR>lookin'down at empty webs<BR>gotta be fed<BR>better off dead...going down,down<P>When the bottom is the top<BR>and you can't make itstop<BR>going down.down<P>Trips of existence<BR>flashing for their instance<BR>I can feel them at a distance<BR>going down,down,down<P><BR>                  STEPHEN||||reg||1
Z||000001||2xsess||10-14-2000||06:20 PM||||Wow, I got a lump in my throat. <P>Sorry to hear about your brother. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
